3. Employee Payroll System
📌 Project Description

Manage employee salary data and calculate monthly payroll.

🧩 Table

employees(emp_id, name, department, salary)

🧪 Practice Questions

Insert employee data.

Display employees from a specific department.

Calculate total salary expense.

Find employee with highest salary.

Update salary by percentage.

Delete employees with salary < 15000.

Sort employees by salary.